      "title": "Biology Department Assistant",
      "description": "Posted: 2026-09-08\n\nLocation: Annville\n\nLebanon Valley College seeks a part-time biology department assistant . Qualifications include a high school diploma or equivalent, and some college coursework preferred, two years’ administrative support experience, and proficiency with Microsoft Office applications (experience with Excel is a plus). Also important are excellent customer service, multi-tasking, and written and oral communication skills. The department assistant is scheduled for 20 hours per week during the academic year (mid-August through mid-May) and the hourly rate is $18.00. Interested applicants should submit a letter of interest, resume, and contact information for three professional references to ADP. A review of applications will begin immediately, the position will remain open until filled. Lebanon Valley College is committed to excellence through its employment practices and welcomes applicants with exceptional qualifications, particularly those with demonstrable commitments to a more inclusive society and world. The College is committed to recruiting and supporting a diverse student body, faculty and staff and promotes a culture of accountability, student centeredness, professionalism, inclusiveness, respect, and empowerment.",
